  "ruleText": "Fam 303.02 Academic Eligibility Requirements. Applicants shall have earned at least a bachelor's degree in any field.\n\nSource. #7917, eff 7-11-03; ss by #8719, eff 11-1-06; ss by #8930, eff 7-4-07; ss by #9674, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12634, eff 10-2-18",
